{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 45, :comments ["<b>And I will remember for them.</b> Forever." "<b>The covenant of the first ones.</b> This is the covenant cut at Sinai, and he calls this generation \"first ones\" in contrast to the children who will be exiled in the land of their enemies. Some say: the fathers of the world. The sense of <b>whom I brought out.</b> Those regarding whom I swore to their fathers to bring their children out of servitude. And the first [interpretation] is correct in my eyes."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:53.440200523Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}